            "review_title": "Review at Galina Lake View",
            "review_text": "Nam Nguyen\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible service\nFeb 2019 • Family\nFirst we are local customer. We came there, crowded b/c in Tet season. We were enjoy at restaurant. First no table, I were asked them and get the answer is yes, but nothing happen, and I need to clean the table by ourselfe. It ok, b/c we understand that holly busy now, but after seat, nobody come and take order, thats still ok, because we understand.\nAfter I can get better table, by ourselfe, of cause, 1 waiter come and take order. And it take little bit long, we still understand. Food come without table set up, cutlerry, and after set up, it terrible, cause very very dirty bowl, I can see rice, spring onion in and on the bowl, we clean by ourselfe, and it ok, cause I understand.\nAfter serve the first course, we wait for the second almost 1 hour. I asked 3-4 time then we get the answer is not available. Really wonderfull, I still ok beacause I understand.\nAnd what I understand?\nThats is you guy is terrible manage, terrible service. Staff dont know how to do, manager dont know how to arrange. And I understand that you give for customer 2-3 stars pricing, but the service under local restaurant out there.\nAlso you have extra charge for Tet holiday, but what your service: Terrible service. You should to shame, manager, you get our money, but give back for us really terrible service.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 10, 2019",
